  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/thomasschafer/scooter/zipball/v0.10.0",
  "body": "## New features:\r\n* Support files that aren't UTF-8, such as Latin-1 by @thomasschafer in https://github.com/thomasschafer/scooter/pull/447\r\n* Make `^` and `$` match at line boundaries in multiline mode by @thomasschafer in https://github.com/thomasschafer/scooter/pull/449\r\n\r\n## Bug fixes:\r\n* Fix stale previews after files change by @thomasschafer in https://github.com/thomasschafer/scooter/pull/448\r\n* Fix open-in-editor panic with no results by @thomasschafer in https://github.com/thomasschafer/scooter/pull/424\r\n\r\n## Other changes:\r\n* Harden CI workflow permissions by @thomasschafer in https://github.com/thomasschafer/scooter/pull/420\r\n* Bump Rust toolchain to 1.97 by @thomasschafer in https://github.com/thomasschafer/scooter/pull/437\r\n* Fix Linux musl release builds after rs-cargo v4 upgrade by @thomasschafer in https://github.com/thomasschafer/scooter/pull/453\r\n* Bump various deps\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/thomasschafer/scooter/compare/v0.9.1...v0.10.0",
